    "chunk_text": "cu\u00f0e ondswaro findan meahte, \u00feeah \u00fee heo georne sohte \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m For\u00feon sumre neahte, \u00fea se sealmsong gefylled w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s uhtlecan lofsonges, \u00fea w\u00e6ron \u00f0a Cristes \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r semninga heofonlic leoht onsended & cwom ofer heo ealle, ond swa swa micel scete W\u00e6s seo beorhtnes \u00fe\u00e6s onsendan leohtes mara, \u00feon sunnan leoht bi\u00f0 \u00e6t middan d\u00e6ge. \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00e6fter medmiclum f\u00e6ce, \u00fe\u00e6t hit w\u00e6s up ah\u00e6fen of \u00fe\u00e6re stowe & gewat in su\u00f0d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fea sum f\u00e6c wunade, & him \u00fea stowe w\u00e6s ontynende, \u00fee heo \u00e6r ymb\u00feeahtedon; & swa \u00de\u00e6s leohtes scima w\u00e6s swa micel, swa swa sum ald bro\u00f0or on morgenne s\u00e6gde, se \u00f0e in \u00fea ilcan W\u00e6s in \u00f0\u00e6m ilcan mynstre cneohtcild sum; ne w\u00e6s yldre \u00feon \u00ferywintre, w\u00e6s his noma \u00e6sica, se \u00d0a w\u00e6s he gehrinen mid \u00fea foresprecenan a\u00f0le. \u00d0a he \u00f0a to \u00fe\u00e6m ytm\u00e6stan dogor bicwom, \u00fea cleopode he \u00f0riga & aane of \u00fe\u00e6m gehalgedum Ond sona \u00fea seo f\u00e6mne, \u00fee he sweltende cegde, in \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee heo w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan Eft sumu of \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan Godes \u00feeowum mid \u00fea foresprecenan a\u00f0le w\u00e6s gestonden & to \u00fe\u00e6m \u00dea ongon heo semninga on midde neaht cleopian \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee",
